# =============================================================================
# Pi Dev — root .gitignore
# Written before `git init` based on an actual inventory of the current tree.
# Last reviewed 2026-09-28 (internal/ consolidated to pi-dev only; samples/
# converted to a runtime-generated fixture; both external/pi and
# external/mini-swe-agent submoduled).
# Distinguishes source-controlled config/fixtures (kept) from runtime-generated
# or nested-repo state (ignored) rather than blanket-ignoring whole folders.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Node --------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/

# --- Python --------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# --- Runtime / session / auth state (generated at run time, not authored) ---
# Explicitly does NOT include models.json (source-controlled placeholder
# template in internal/pi-dev/) -- that stays tracked.
**/auth.json
**/sessions/
**/models-store.json
internal/pi-dev/config/settings.json

# --- Generated artifacts ----------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- OS / editor local -------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Runtime-generated fixture (rebuilt from samples-template/ by
# reset-samples.cmd; its own throwaway git repo lives inside it -- never
# committed to root Git) -----------------------------------------------------
internal/pi-dev/samples/

# --- Local-only experiment repos (own independent .git, intentionally never
# absorbed into root Git or converted to submodules) -------------------------
experiments/manual-playground/
experiments/pi-tui-playground/

# --- Defensive: browser/runtime artifacts should never land inside this repo
# (they belong in %USERPROFILE%\.pi-personal\ instead) -- not currently
# present anywhere in the tree, kept here as a guard rail.
**/browser-profiles/
**/screenshots/
**/downloads/

# =============================================================================
# Intentionally NOT ignored, listed here so nobody "cleans them up" by mistake:
#   internal/pi-dev/config/models.json     -- source-controlled placeholder
#   internal/pi-dev/samples-template/      -- source-controlled canonical fixture
#   internal/pi-dev/samples-template/.gitignore -- part of the template on purpose
#   external/pi/, external/mini-swe-agent/ -- clean upstream clones, both
#                                              converted to proper git submodules (.gitmodules)
# =============================================================================
